      "version": "10007253922 / 02",
      "date": "2022-12",
      "url": "https://static.weg.net/medias/downloadcenter/hc7/h04/WEG-ruw100-modbus-rtu-manual-do-usuario-10007253922-pt.pdf",
      "note": "chapters 3 to 6 and the parameter list of appendix A (head unit and slot 1 digital I/O)",
